{%- capture subject -%}Reset your {{ product.name }} password{%- endcapture -%}
{%- capture html -%}
<p>Hi{% if name %} {{ name }}{% endif %},</p>
<p>We received a request to reset the password of your {{ product.name }} account.</p>
<p style="margin:28px 0;"><a href="{{ link }}" style="display:inline-block;padding:12px 20px;background:{{ product.color }};color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:8px;font-weight:600;">Choose a new password</a></p>
<p style="color:#6b7280;font-size:13px;">The link expires in 1 hour and works only once. If you did not ask for a reset, you can ignore this email; your password stays the same.</p>
{%- endcapture -%}
{%- capture text -%}
Hi{% if name %} {{ name }}{% endif %},

We received a request to reset the password of your {{ product.name }} account. Choose a new password here:

{{ link }}

The link expires in 1 hour and works only once. If you did not ask for a reset, you can ignore this email; your password stays the same.
{%- endcapture -%}
